    "image_path": "images/slide_03.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "在远古的荒野之中，有一座\n高耸入云的大山，叫成都载天山。\n在大山深处，生活着一个巨人部落，部落的首领叫夸父。夸父力大无穷，\n气概非凡，他喜欢在耳朵上挂着两条\n黄蛇，手里还不时抓着两条蛇挥舞。\n3/17",
    "page_text_en": "In the ancient wilderness, there was a towering mountain reaching into the clouds, called Chengdu Zaitianshan.\nDeep in the mountains, a giant tribe lived. The tribe's leader was Kuafu. Kuafu was immensely strong and extraordinary in spirit. He liked to hang two yellow snakes from his ears and often held two snakes in his hands, waving them.\n3/17",
    "summary_zh": "本页描绘了远古荒野中的成都载天山，以及生活在山中的巨人部落首领夸父，他力大无穷，耳挂黄蛇，手持蛇杖，部落成员在周围劳作、生活。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "夸父逐日",
    "title_en": "Kuafu Chases the Sun",
    "target_age": "7-10",
    "source_type": "pptx",
    "source_file": "夸父逐日（7-10岁）.pptx",
    "page_index_in_story": 4,
    "source_page": 4,
    "image_path": "images/slide_04.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "那时候大地荒凉，大山里猛兽横行。\n夸父经常带领着部落里的人和野兽搏斗。\n他骁勇善战，深得大家的信任和爱戴。",
    "page_text_en": "At that time, the earth was desolate, and fierce beasts roamed the mountains.\nKuafu often led the people of his tribe in battles against wild animals.\nHe was brave and skilled in combat, earning the trust and admiration of everyone.",
    "summary_zh": "本页描绘了远古时期荒凉的大地上猛兽横行，夸父带领部落成员与野兽搏斗，展现了他骁勇善战、深受爱戴的形象。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "夸父逐日",
    "title_en": "Kuafu Chases the Sun",
    "target_age": "7-10",
    "source_type": "pptx",
    "source_file": "夸父逐日（7-10岁）.pptx",
    "page_index_in_story": 5,
    "source_page": 5,
    "image_path": "images/slide_05.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "这一年，炎热的夏天持续了很久，白天也比往年漫长。火辣辣的太阳烤死了庄稼，晒焦了树木，山中干涸得没有一滴水。人们热得难以忍受，夸父族中有人甚至被太阳晒死。族人的境况让夸父非常着急，他看着天上的太阳，整日沉思。",
    "page_text_en": "This year, the hot summer lasted a long time, and the days were longer than usual. The scorching sun baked the crops to death, scorched the trees, and dried up the mountains with not a drop of water. People suffered from the heat, and some members of the Kuafu tribe even died from the sun's rays. The tribe's plight made Kuafu very anxious. He looked up at the sun and pondered deeply every day.",
    "summary_zh": "本页描绘了炎热的夏天持续不断，太阳炙烤大地，导致庄稼枯死、树木焦枯、山中干涸，夸父族人饱受酷热之苦，甚至有人被晒死，夸父为此深感忧虑，整日凝视太阳沉思。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "夸父逐日",
    "title_en": "Kuafu Chases the Sun",
    "target_age": "7-10",
    "source_type": "pptx",
    "source_file": "夸父逐日（7-10岁）.pptx",
    "page_index_in_story": 6,
    "source_page": 6,
    "image_path": "images/slide_06.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "终于，夸父做了一个决定：\n“听说太阳落下的地方在禺谷，\n我要去那里，找到太阳！”\n夸父的族人很担心，纷纷劝\n他不要冒险。\n\n“太阳离我们那么远，你找过去会累死的。”\n“太阳太可怕了，你会被烤死的。再说，你找到\n太阳后又能怎么办呢？”\n“我要去追太阳！”夸父心意已决，“我追到太阳\n后，要恳求它每天早点儿休息，别再长时间烤我们\n了。”夸父族人的生活一天比一天苦，似乎也没有别\n的办法了，大家只好同意让夸父去试试。",
    "page_text_en": "Finally, Kuafu made a decision:\n\"I've heard the sun sets in Yugǔ. I'm going there to find the sun!\"\nKuafu's tribe was very worried and urged him not to take the risk.\n\n\"The sun is so far away, you'll exhaust yourself trying to reach it.\"\n\"The sun is too terrifying, you'll be roasted to death. Besides, what will you do once you find it?\"\n\"I'm going to chase the sun!\" Kuafu declared firmly. \"Once I catch up to it, I'll beg it to rest earlier each day, and not bake us for so long.\" The life of Kuafu's tribe was getting harder and harder. With no other options, everyone reluctantly agreed to let Kuafu try.",
    "summary_zh": "夸父决定去禺谷追赶太阳，以求太阳早点休息，减轻族人酷热之苦。族人虽担心劝阻，但因无其他办法，最终同意他去尝试。"
  },
