    "page_index_in_story": 7,
    "source_page": 7,
    "image_path": "images/slide_07.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "这一天，太阳刚刚升起，夸父就告别族人，怀着雄心壮志，向着东海边上太阳升起的方向，迈开大步，开始了追逐太阳的征程。",
    "page_text_en": "On this day, as the sun rose, Kuafu bid farewell to his people, filled with lofty ambition. He headed toward the eastern sea, where the sun rose, took large strides, and began his journey to chase the sun.",
    "summary_zh": "夸父在太阳初升时告别族人，怀着雄心壮志，朝着东海方向迈开大步，开始了追逐太阳的征程。"
