    "page_text_ocr_zh": "夸父翻过一座座高山，跨过一条条河流，穿过一道道深邃的峡谷……他拼命地追呀追，脚下好似有疾风，跑得飞快，大地被他的脚步震得“轰轰”作响。",
    "page_text_en": "Kuafu climbed over mountain after mountain, crossed river after river, and passed through deep, narrow gorges... He chased desperately, as if the wind were beneath his feet, running at lightning speed. The earth trembled beneath his steps, making a '轰轰' sound.",
    "summary_zh": "夸父在追逐太阳的途中，翻山越岭、跨河穿谷，奔跑速度极快，脚步声震得大地轰鸣。"
